---
// Standalone page rather than the BlogPost layout. That layout stamps a pubDate
// and a hero image on whatever it wraps, which is why this page used to claim it
// was published in August 2021. An About page is not a dated post.
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead
			title="About — Narayan Lekhi"
			description="A high school student working in sports analytics, bringing basic analytics to his school's basketball team."
		/>
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<h1>About</h1>
			<div class="prose">
				<p>
					I'm a high school student working in sports analytics. My projects start with
					something I notice during games and can't find answers to.
				</p>
				<p>
					Right now I'm bringing basic analytics to my school's basketball team. Half of the
					work is the data analysis and the other more important half is translation. A
					coach in a timeout or a player making a decision at a crossroads has no use for a
					regression table. So it's my job to present these findings in a digestible format
					where it becomes beneficial.
				</p>
				<p>
					I also lead the sports analytics club at my school where I spearhead discussions
					and teach other students who are interested in sports beyond the box score. It's
					a place where not only do I teach, but I gain new perspective through the lens of
					other students. After all, there's a lot I haven't learned yet, which is why I
					want to grow and share as much of my journey as I can.
				</p>
			</div>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
